        "id": 209551,
        "name": "Raccoonoo",
        "username": "Raccoonoo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/raccoonoo/{size}/2108_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-30T20:32:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was stated he's using necromancy to create the fleshchildren, so I'd hazard a guess that he needs dead flesh to make the magic happen. That does make me wonder the extent of his necromantic abilities though, especially considering that no one who comes back to life in Sentinels Comics has a very good time of it.</p>",
